      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHOJI AKIMICHI (8) was in the minors two back (19.52) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Has a good record here at this journey. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Rates on top in this line up. GETTING NERVOUS (4) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.75 lengths second (19.51) behind Zipping Popyrin at this track. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Leading chance. LUCA SKYWALKER (6) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (19.84) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has never missed the frame here from three starts. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Can feature again. MISS CHARMED (3) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
